# OLED55G6WUA, the US 55-inch G6: the models DB lists it for this OTA ID (W26O, markets US and
# CA_EN). The default board (board_cmdline in guest/targets/soc/): W26O's own hw-option-gen and
# nyx-option-gen (queue 43.11.77) decode this line as O26, US/ATSC, 3G OLED, UHD panel,
# 1920x1080 graphics and 120 Hz panel and SoC output; libdile_boardinfo's group of the line is 2,
# configd's USA RMM grpCode. 3G: every W26O device profile declares it (devices.json, and
# TV_2026_o26_W26O_OLED_3G_G6 for this tool type); with 2.5G no profile matched, systemprofile
# lacked five profiles and sdx never came up. ToolOpt: LLS's factory default record of this
# line, with the G6/55" panelInch and toolType of the firmware's factory tables. O26 A0 is a VM
# choice; identity placeholders are replaced per VM.
ethaddr=02:00:00:12:34:56
devtmpfs.mount=1
countryGrp=2
modelopt=000000000
hwopt=500200010106102000
ToolOpt=2187537:1310739:1706322:4194832:12068147:571595531
modelName=OLED55G6WUA
debugMode=3
serialNum=000RAXX00001
chip=O26A0
emmc_size=0x1d2000000
cmdEnd
